{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51139","headline":"题雷威琴 · 欧阳询","name":"题雷威琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合雅大乐，成文正音。\n徽弦一泛，山水俱深。\n（《西溪丛语》上）（《西溪丛语》云：「长兄伯声云：昔至渑邑，获一古琴，中题云〖略〗。\n雷威断，欧阳询书，陕郊处士魏野家藏。\n」同书复录雷威大历三年题字，知欧、雷并非同时之人。\n此诗如爲欧作，则诗题误。\n颇疑「欧阳询书」云云，仅指其字体爲欧书，而非必欧本人之作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳询","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}